## Vendored Source Code

### captcha-rs (MIT)

`src/services/captcha/generator.rs` is a derivative work of the `captcha-rs`
crate, v0.5.0. It was vendored so that CaptchAPI can select the `image` and
`imageproc` feature sets directly (upstream forces `image/default`, which
pulls in every image codec) and so that the proprietary font upstream embeds
could be replaced — see "Embedded Fonts" below.

- Upstream: https://github.com/samirdjelal/captcha-rs
